  "arduino": "// The slider changes blink speed. The SPDT switch enables the blink.\n// Switch middle terminal 2 selects terminal 1 (GND) or 3 (5V).\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n  pinMode(2, INPUT);\n  pinMode(LED_BUILTIN, OUTPUT);\n}\nvoid loop() {\n  int value = analogRead(A0);\n  bool enabled = digitalRead(2);\n  Serial.print(value); Serial.print(','); Serial.println(enabled);\n  digitalWrite(LED_BUILTIN, enabled);\n  delay(map(value, 0, 1023, 80, 900));\n  digitalWrite(LED_BUILTIN, LOW);\n  delay(100);\n}\n",
